OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are some hosepipe bans still
OL,4,Ain place?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWessex Water, South West Water, Severn
OL,7,FTrent and Thames Water are yet to lift
OL,8,Ftheir bans, but have thanked their
OL,9,Fcustomers for their continued careful
OL,10,Fwater use.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
